## Quick Start

### Prerequisiti
- Python 3.11 o superiore
- pip
- Browser web

### Installazione

```bash
git clone https://github.com/ballales1984-wq/bikemaster.git
cd bikemaster
python -m venv .venv
.venv\Scripts\activate     # Windows
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### Avvio

```bash
# API + Dashboard (default)
python main.py api

# Solo frontend standalone
python main.py web

# CLI demo analytics
python main.py cli
```

Apri http://localhost:8000 per la dashboard.

### Docker

```bash
docker compose up -d
```

---

## Configurazione

Copia `.env.example` in `.env` e configura:

```env
DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./rides.db
API_HOST=0.0.0.0
API_PORT=8000
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_key_here        # Opzionale
SERPAPI_API_KEY=your_key_here            # Opzionale
GROQ_API_KEY=your_key_here               # Opzionale per AI Coach
SECRET_KEY=your_secret_key               # Obbligatorio per JWT
```

